        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Renée Montagne, Steve Inskeep, David Greene, Bob Edwards\n- Organizations: National Public Radio\n- Programs: Morning Edition\n- Roles: Radio journalist, broadcast journalist, co-host, host\n\nFacts:\n- Bob Edwards, born on May 16, 1947, is an American broadcast journalist.\n- Bob Edwards is a Peabody Award-winning member of the National Radio Hall of Fame.\n- Renée Montagne is an American radio journalist.\n- In May 2004, Renée Montagne became a co-host of National Public Radio's weekday morning news program Morning Edition with Steve Inskeep.\n- Renée Montagne and Steve Inskeep succeeded longtime host Bob Edwards on Morning Edition, initially as interim replacements.\n- In 2012, David Greene joined the Morning Edition hosting team.\n- Renée Montagne co-hosted Morning Edition with Steve Inskeep and David Greene until November 11, 2016.",
